    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-3278/blocks/prose-sec-004",
      "source": "sections/sec-004-des-progrès-insuffisants.md",
      "source_hash": "693ef7c507688ad7fcec83cf52501166e018ceb46f164548002d7555fd216b0c",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Notes that, despite GAVI support, global coverage with Haemophilus influenzae type b vaccine was only 38% in 2009 and that pneumococcal conjugate and rotavirus vaccines had been introduced in few countries. It mentions an advance market commitment for pneumococcal vaccine with set per-dose prices.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-3278/blocks/prose-sec-005",
      "source": "sections/sec-005-quelques-innovations.md",
      "source_hash": "96160e4dbde7f01c9eedc587e74977e7f98badea010a0a593e0463d410b6d9b6",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Notes the introduction of human papillomavirus vaccines in 26 countries and a low-cost meningococcal A conjugate vaccine made in India, along with a footnote listing GAVI-eligible countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-3278/blocks/prose-sec-006",
      "source": "sections/sec-006-de-nombreux-problèmes-subsistent.md",
      "source_hash": "e82d04b15cf8dbee63ad8981619d9eac7fbb565e5acf8da1d529b6b8aa3a2aa9",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Lists obstacles slowing the introduction of new vaccines, including high prices, lack of national technical advisory groups, weak data and inaccurate claims about side-effects. Some countries delayed or suspended vaccine use as a result.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-3278/blocks/prose-sec-007",
      "source": "sections/sec-007-synergies-avec-dautres-programmes-de-santé-dans.md",
      "source_hash": "7954729930a84290aaae252ed7b6956c2272a5b00fb2099b35ea1332ec508a06",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes how immunization services increasingly deliver integrated primary care, such as child health days with vitamin A, bednets and deworming. It mentions comprehensive disease-control plans such as the global pneumonia action plan and strategies like Reaching Every District to improve equitable access.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-3278/blocks/prose-sec-008",
      "source": "sections/sec-008-surveillance-et-suivi.md",
      "source_hash": "2fc8dc6ef84b1da5103bf200c041324290e0411659fa8c5f8d18e78ffc088ce5",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Stresses the role of disease surveillance in immunization and describes a WHO-coordinated sentinel network for invasive bacterial disease and rotavirus diarrhoea covering 46 low-income countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
